---
description: "Next.js frontend conventions"
globs: apps/web/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- Server components by default; "use client" only where state is needed.
- API data: component -> hook from apps/web/lib/hooks -> apps/web/lib/api.ts -> types from packages/shared.
  There is no direct fetch in components.
- Every form has labels, keyboard focus and error messages.
- Example page with a form: @apps/web/app/labs/[id]/submit/page.tsx
